SUMMARY:Salvation Army Light Parade
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a spectacular evening of twinkling lights and holiday magic at the annual Nashville Indiana Christmas Light Parade! Experience the enchanting sights and sounds of the holiday season as festive floats and vehicles adorned with dazzling Christmas lights glide through the heart of Nashville, Indiana.\nFestive Lighted Parade\nThe Nashville, Indiana, Christmas Light Parade is a cherished community tradition that brings together families, friends, and visitors from near and far. Be amazed by the creativity and holiday spirit as local businesses, organizations, and individuals showcase their beautifully decorated floats and vehicles. From whimsical displays to heartwarming scenes, every entry is a glowing testament to the season’s joy.\nSpreading Holiday Cheer\nAs the parade winds through the picturesque streets of Nashville, witness the town come alive with Christmas cheer. Spectators will be treated to delightful performances, live music, and appearances by beloved holiday characters. The spirit of the season will fill the air as families gather to share in the warmth and magic of this festive event.\nSupporting The Salvation Army Toy Shoppe\nAt the heart of the Nashville, Indiana, Christmas Light Parade is the spirit of giving. In the true holiday tradition, we encourage all participants and attendees to bring new, unwrapped toys to donate to The Salvation Army Toy Shoppe and spread joy to those less fortunate during this particular time of year.  Let’s unite as a community to make a difference and brighten the lives of children who deserve a magical Christmas.\nDon’t miss out on this joyous occasion that encapsulates the true spirit of Christmas. Gather your loved ones and come to witness the brilliance of the Nashville, Indiana, Christmas Light Parade! Together, we can create memories that will last a lifetime and bring joy to those in need.\nLet’s light up Nashville and make this holiday season one to remember!\n\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/salvation-army-light-parade/
ORGANIZER;CN=The Salvation Army:MAILTO:usc.ind.bco.corps@usc.salvationarmy.org
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Happening,Holiday,Parade,Plan Your Visit,Special Events,Winter
LOCATION:Nashville
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Light-Parade.jpg
END:VEVENT
