SUMMARY:Crooked Creek Adventure Paddle
DESCRIPTION:Explore the headwaters of Lake Monroe on this easy kayaking adventure. The tour will begin at the Crooked Creek State Recreation Area in western Brown County. Guide David Rupp will lead the group through a mix of open water and narrow channels while teaching about the history of the area and the birds and wildlife that inhabit it. This area is one of the most remote in Indiana… a great place to escape to for some peace and rejuvenation! All equipment provided: Single-person sit-in kayaks, paddles, life jackets, binoculars. Maximum of 6 participants. Private tours can be scheduled by contacting David.\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/crooked-creek-adventure-paddle/
