SUMMARY:Mossy Rock Pop Up
DESCRIPTION:\n\nAttention plant lovers! Follow along as our fun staff guide your own terrarium build in the charming Antique Alley Beer Garden.\n\n\n\n\nDIY Terrarium in the Beer Garden\nJoin us in person for a super chill afternoon hosted by Mossy Rock! Get your hands dirty and create your very own DIY terrarium while soaking up the good vibes of the beer garden. Perfect for plant lovers and anyone looking for a fun, creative escape. Our fun and friendly staff will guide you through the process, so no experience is needed to make a work of art that is uniquely you.\nYou will receive the following materials:\n*50 ounce lidded glass container\n*Substrate material\n*3 plants\n*Mosses\n*Feature stones\n*Decorative sand and pebbles\n*Fun figurine\nThis event will be held in the beautiful outdoor Antique Ally Beer Garden Patio under a pergola. Beer and wine will be available for purchase. Event begins at 5:00 but the garden is open all day so arrive early to imbibe if desired.\n\n\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/mossy-rock-pop-up/
