SUMMARY:Chocolate Walk
DESCRIPTION:Tickets for the 2026 Chocolate Walk will go on sale online on August 15th. \n$30 per ticket through September 30th. Price increases to $35 on October 1st if any remain.\nStroll through the beautiful town of Nashville as you sample chocolate-themed treats from nearly 40 local shops and restaurants. You can even do a little early holiday shopping along the way!\nCome alone, or with a friend, or invite a group of friends and make a weekend out of it. Some friends and families make it a yearly event! Whatever you do, it’s guilt-free pleasure because all of the money supports the homeless pets of Brown County!\n
